    <string name="about_description">Bedduu helps readers discover and read manga from available online sources. Manga titles, images, and chapters are provided by their respective websites; availability and rights remain with those sources and their owners.</string>
    <string name="about_terms_body">Bedduu does not host or own third-party manga, cover art, chapter images, or translations. Content availability is controlled by the linked websites and may change. Use each source in accordance with its terms, applicable laws, and rights-holder policies. Bedduu is independent and is not affiliated with the listed sources.</string>
    <string name="about_sources_description">These third-party websites are currently integrated as browsing sources. Selecting one opens its website; each source is responsible for its own content and policies.</string>
